Relevant part of the speech is extracted below;
"RSS ke Logon Ne Gandhiji Ko Goli Maari Aur Unke Log Gandhiji Ki Baat Karte Hai.
Sardar Patel, Sardar Patel Congress party Ke Neta The Unhone RSS Ke Bare Me Saaf Suthra Likha Hai.

While expounding the scope of Article 21 of the Constitution, apart from other sections,
it has been observed by the Supreme Court in paragraph 31 which reads thus;
"31. Free and fair trial is sine qua non of Art. 21 of the Constitution.
